  "description": "围炉（campfire）→ DeepSeek Harness 渠道插件：把围炉群消息投进 DSH 会话，把回复发回围炉。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.5.0"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
